[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5887190311","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123950#issuecomment-5887190311","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123950","id":5887190311,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXudlJw","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-29T09:11:19Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T09:11:19Z","body":"I'm not sure this is a bug, the resource thars already loaded isn't changed, I don't think this is something that's meant to be relied on in this way, in fact reloading from file blocks signals to prevent noise\n\nInstead I'd say you should listen to changes to resource files by using `EditorFileSystem`","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5887190311/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5887282440","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123950#issuecomment-5887282440","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123950","id":5887282440,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXujNCA","user":{"login":"TheMagnat","id":45939503,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTM5NTAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45939503?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat","html_url":"https://github.com/TheMagnat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-29T09:17:34Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T09:17:34Z","body":"> I'm not sure this is a bug, the resource thars already loaded isn't changed, I don't think this is something that's meant to be relied on in this way, in fact reloading from file blocks signals to prevent noise\n\nIn this case, it's should never emit resource changed in the editor or in runtime (and not only when `append_import_external_resource` is not called), this is a MRP but in the project where I encountered this bug the resource do get changed and the same behavior can be observed\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5887282440/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5887310303","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123950#issuecomment-5887310303","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123950","id":5887310303,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXuk53w","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-29T09:19:27Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T09:19:27Z","body":"What do you mean? I mean that the signal is blocked when reloading a resource from file, not in the editor ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5887310303/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5887782502","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123950#issuecomment-5887782502","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123950","id":5887782502,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXvBuZg","user":{"login":"TheMagnat","id":45939503,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTM5NTAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45939503?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat","html_url":"https://github.com/TheMagnat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-29T09:49:27Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T09:49:48Z","body":"Ok I think I understand your point. You mean that the resource we reimport is different than the resource we loaded and connected its changed signal to.\n\nI did more testing :\n\n1. I tested by verifying if the signal is still connected to our event function every frame on the reloaded object in case the object changed, and from what I can see I do get true even after reimporting the resource.\n\nHere is the code I used :\n\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends Node2D\n\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar res: Test = preload(\"res://res.test\")\n\tres.changed.connect(_on_changed)\n\nfunc _physics_process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tprint(load(\"res://res.test\").changed.is_connected(_on_changed))\n\nfunc _on_changed() -> void:\n\tprint(\"RES changed\")\n```\n\n2. I also added a value the my res resource to verify if it do get edited and from what I can see it's even worth than not emitting the changed signal, the resource shown in the editor simply does not get updated if `append_import_external_resource`. I've added an int with a count that increment every time _import is called, and the value does get updated in the exported .tres if opened with an external editor but remain the same in the editor. If reloading the editor, the correct value get shown. This disappear when remove the line `append_import_external_resource`.\n\nHere is the code I used :\n\n```\nfunc _import(\n\tsource_file: String, save_path: String, _options: Dictionary,\n\t_platform_variants: Array[String], _gen_files: Array[String]\n) -> Error:\n\tvar error: Error\n\t\n\tvar test := Test.new()\n\ttest.test = count\n\tcount += 1\n\tprint(count)\n\t\n\terror = ResourceSaver.save(test, \"%s.%s\" % [save_path, _get_save_extension()])\n\tif error != OK:\n\t\treturn error\n\t\n\tappend_import_external_resource(\"res://icon.svg\")\n\t\n\treturn OK\n```\n\nAnd added `@export var test: int = 0` in test_res.gd\n\nI'm updating the MRP to show this behavior","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5887782502/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5887909265","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123950#issuecomment-5887909265","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123950","id":5887909265,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXvJdkQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-29T09:57:36Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T09:57:36Z","body":"What do you mean not get updated? Is this bug about a value changing or the signal?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5887909265/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5887953484","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123950#issuecomment-5887953484","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123950","id":5887953484,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXvMKTA","user":{"login":"TheMagnat","id":45939503,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTM5NTAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45939503?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat","html_url":"https://github.com/TheMagnat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-29T10:00:40Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T10:03:59Z","body":"> What do you mean not get updated? Is this bug about a value changing or the signal?\n\nThe value shown in the editor does not get updated and the changed signal not emitted too (after verifying I'm listening to the same resource in the memory)\n\nHere is a video and the new MRP :\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7b8d9a14-b99e-4523-aead-227ea85dac7f\n\n[MrpChangedNotEmitted_updated.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32797053/MrpChangedNotEmitted_updated.zip)\n\n(small typo in the code, it say that she value should be n + 1, but it should be n, I increment after updating the value)\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5887953484/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5888169761","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123950#issuecomment-5888169761","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123950","id":5888169761,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXvZXIQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShip