}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-29T10:18:21Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T10:18:21Z","body":"> Got it that was not in the original report\n\nYes sorry, I didn't necessarily express myself very well and I discovered these latest impacts while talking to you","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5888222570/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5921752025","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123950#issuecomment-5921752025","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123950","id":5921752025,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYPbD2Q","user":{"login":"TheMagnat","id":45939503,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTM5NTAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45939503?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat","html_url":"https://github.com/TheMagnat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-30T23:45:46Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T23:45:46Z","body":"Ok I did some testing and here is what's happening:\n\n- EditorFileSystem::reimport_files called for resource 1\n- resources_reimporting emited for resource 1 which call EditorNode::_resources_reimporting and fill resources_reimported with resource 1 path\n- EditorFileSystem::reimport_append get called for resource 2\n- resources_reimporting emited for resource 2 which call EditorNode::_resources_reimporting and clear resources_reimported\n\nEditorNode::_resources_reimported then get called for resource 2 then 1, but resources_reimported is now missing resource 1 path and reload_from_file is skipped","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5921752025/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]